   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Naive and idealistic Jefferson Smith, leader of the Boy Rangers, is appointed on a lark by the spineless governor of his state. He is reunited with the state's senior senator--presidential hopeful and childhood hero, Senator Joseph Paine. In Washington, however, Smith discovers many of the shortcomings of the political process as his earnest goal of a national boys' camp leads to a conflict with the state political boss, Jim Taylor. Taylor first tries to corrupt Smith and then later attempts to destroy Smith through a scandal." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
<http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0031725> a <https://schema.org/Movie> ;
   rdfs:label "Ninotchka" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "A stern Russian woman sent to Paris on official business finds herself attracted to a man who represents everything she is supposed to detest." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000509> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0001256> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0002048> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0163257> ;
