   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "8.0"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Returning from a year up the Amazon studying snakes, the rich but unsophisticated Charles Pike meets con-artist Jean Harrington on a ship. They fall in love, but a misunderstanding causes them to split on bad terms. To get back at him, Jean disguises herself as an English lady, and comes back to tease and torment him." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
