   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "7.2"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "After a long career as a lawman that made him a legend, Wyatt Earp decides to quit and join his brothers in Tombstone, Arizona. There he would see them in a feud with the Clantons, a local clan of thugs and cattle thieves. When the showdown becomes inevitable, the help will come from Doc Holliday, a terminally-ill gambler who happens to be another Wild West legend." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
<http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0050539> a <https://schema.org/Movie> ;
   rdfs:label "The Incredible Shrinking Man" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "When Scott Carey begins to shrink because of exposure to a combination of radiation and insecticide, medical science is powerless to help him." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0448655> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0486742> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0835836> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0930695> ;
