   rdfs:label "Pierrot le Fou" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "Pierrot escapes his boring society and travels from Paris to the Mediterranean Sea with Marianne, a girl chased by hit-men from Algeria. They lead an unorthodox life, always on the run." ;
