   <https://schema.org/description> "Honest and hard-working Texas rancher Homer Bannon has a conflict with his unscrupulous, selfish, arrogant and egotistical son Hud, who sank into alcoholism after accidentally killing his brother in a car crash." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0002048> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0623658> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0001121> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000056> ;
