   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "6.7"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Nerd. Milquetoast. Klutz. These are just three of the many undesirable words that can be used to describe Professor Julius Kelp. But all that changes when the chemistry expert invents a potion that transforms him into a suave, sexy chick magnet, whom Julius aptly names Buddy Love. Unfortunately, there's one side effect: Buddy can't control when he'll change back into Julius, an event that always happens at inopportune times. How will Julius/Buddy resolve his Jekyll-and-Hyde dilemma?" ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
