   <https://schema.org/description> "The lives of a disparate group of contestants intertwine in an inhumanely grueling dance marathon." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000404> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0765546> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0948772> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0949574> ;
