   <https://schema.org/description> "It's April 5, 1941, somewhere in Serbia. A group of people go on a bus to Belgrade, on a journey that will change their lives forever." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0073353> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0631877> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0831262> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0904303> ;
