   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "4.8"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Elwood, the now lone \"Blues Brother\" finally released from prison, is once again enlisted by Sister Mary Stigmata in her latest crusade to raise funds for a children's hospital. Once again hitting the road to re-unite the band and win the big prize at the New Orleans Battle of the Bands, Elwood is pursued cross-country by the cops, led by Cabel the Curtis' son (and Elwood's step-brother), the Russian Mafia, and a militia group. On his new \"mission from God\" Elwood enlists the help of a young orphan, and a strip club bartender." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" , "Russian" .
