   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "After escaping from the alien moon, the ship carrying Ellen Ripley crashes onto a remote and inhabited ore refinery. While living in the ore refinery until she is rescued by her employers, Ripley discovers the horrifying reason for her crash: An alien stowaway. As the alien matures and begins to kill off the inhabitants, Ripley is unaware that her true enemy is more than just the killer alien." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
<http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0118583> a <https://schema.org/Movie> ;
