   rdfs:label "From Beyond" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "A group of scientists have developed the Resonator, a machine which allows whoever is within range to see beyond normal perceptible reality. But when the experiment succeeds, they are immediately attacked by terrible life forms." ;
