   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "When the newly-christened starship Enterprise's shakedown cruise goes poorly, Captain Kirk and crew put her into Spacedock for repairs. But an urgent mission interrupts their Earth-bound shore leave. A renegade Vulcan named Sybok has taken three ambassadors hostage on Nimbus III, the Planet of Galactic Peace. This event also attracts the attention of a Klingon captain who wants to make a name for himself and sets out to pursue the Enterprise. Sybok's ragtag army captures the Enterprise and takes her on a journey to the center of the galaxy in search of the Supreme Being." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" , "Klingon" .
<http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0102975> a <https://schema.org/Movie> ;
   rdfs:label "Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country" ;
