   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "6.5"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "A small, seemingly innocuous plastic reel of film leads surveillance specialist Tom Welles down an increasingly dark and frightening path. With the help of the streetwise Max, Welles relentlessly follows a bizarre trail of evidence to determine the fate of a complete stranger. As his work turns into obsession, he drifts farther and farther away from his wife, family and simple life as a small-town private eye." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
