   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Nada, a down-on-his-luck construction worker, discovers a pair of special sunglasses. Wearing them, he is able to see the world as it really is: people being bombarded by media and government with messages like \"Stay Asleep\", \"No Imagination\", \"Submit to Authority\". Even scarier is that he is able to see that some usually normal-looking people are in fact ugly aliens in charge of the massive campaign to keep humans subdued." ;
