   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "As a young girl in Japan, Nagiko's father paints characters on her face, and her aunt reads to her from \"The Pillow Book\", the diary of a 10th-century lady-in-waiting. Nagiko grows up, obsessed with books, papers, and writing on bodies, and her sexual odyssey (and the creation of her own Pillow Book) is a \"parfait mélange\" of classical Japanese, modern Chinese, and Western film images." ;
