   <https://schema.org/description> "A young drifter working on a river barge disrupts his employers' lives while hiding the fact that he knows more about a dead woman found in the river than he admits." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000191> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0607865> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0842770> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0611932> ;
