   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "6.8"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Vada Sultenfuss is obsessed with death. Her mother is dead, and her father runs a funeral parlor. She is also in love with her English teacher, and joins a poetry class over the summer just to impress him. Thomas J., her best friend, is \"allergic to everything\", and sticks with Vada despite her hangups. When Vada's father hires Shelly, a makeup expert, in his funeral parlor, and begins to fall in love with her, Vada is outraged and does everything in her power to split them up." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
