   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "\"Memories\" is made up of three separate science-fiction stories. In the first, \"Magnetic Rose,\" four space travelers are drawn into an abandoned spaceship that contains a world created by one woman's memories. In \"Stink Bomb,\" a young lab assistant accidentally transforms himself into a human biological weapon set on a direct course for Tôkyô. The final episode, \"Cannon Fodder,\" depicts a day in the life of a city whose entire purpose is the firing of cannons at an unseen enemy." ;
