   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "The career of a disillusioned producer, who is desperate for a hit, is endangered when his star walks off the film set. Forced to think fast, the producer decides to digitally create an actress \"Simone\" to sub for the star--the first totally believable synthetic actress. The \"actress\" becomes an overnight sensation, with a major singing career as well, and everyone thinks she's a real person. However, as Simone's fame skyrockets, he cannot bear to admit his fraud to himself or the world." ;
