   rdfs:label "A Goofy Movie" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "When Max makes an preposterous promise to a girl he has a crush on, his chances to fulfilling it seem hopeless when he is dragged onto a cross-country trip with his embarrassing father, Goofy." ;
