   rdfs:label "Exorcist: The Beginning" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "Years before Father Lancaster Merrin helped save Regan MacNeil's soul, he first encounters the demon Pazuzu in East Africa. This is the tale of Father Merrin's initial battle with Pazuzu and the rediscovery of his faith." ;
