   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "7.1"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "An odd epidemic appears across the globe: people suddenly lose one of their senses. At first, it's an outbreak of loss of smell. It's often presaged by a destructive temper tantrum. In this mix are a scientist and a chef - she's Susan, one of a team trying to understand the epidemic; he's Michael, charming and engaging. Susan and Michael begin a relationship in the middle of increasing chaos, as the loss of other senses plagues more people and as civil authorities try to maintain order. Susan's voice-over reflections provide insight. Is love possible in such a changed world? Can anything make perfect sense?" ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" , "Sign Languages" .
