   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "4.2"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Melanie Porter (Raven-Symone)is a talented high school graduate who has selected a University 800 miles from home. Her over protective father, James (Martin Lawrence) doesn't want her to be so far away, so he cooks up a plot to try to convince her to go to a local University. On the guise of going to her selected university, he forces a visit to his preferred (close to home) school. This is a typical road trip movie with lost cars, bumming rides on buses and planes, covering that difficult time of life when a father loses control of his daughter." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
