   rdfs:label "The Pirates! Band of Misfits" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "Pirate Captain sets out on a mission to defeat his rivals Black Bellamy and Cutlass Liz for the Pirate of the year Award. The quest takes Captain and his crew from the shores of Blood Island to the foggy streets of Victorian London." ;
