   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "5.3"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "\"WHAT THE #$*! DO WE KNOW?!\" is a radical departure from convention. It demands a freedom of view and greatness of thought so far unknown, indeed, not even dreamed of since Copernicus. It's a documentary. It's a story. It's mind-blowing special effects. This film plunges you into a world where quantum uncertainty is demonstrated - where neurological processes, and perceptual shifts are engaged and lived by its protagonist - where everything is alive, and reality is changed by every thought." ;
