   <https://schema.org/description> "Based on the true story, two homicide detectives track Martha Beck and Raymond Martinez Fernandez, a murderous pair known as the \"Lonely Hearts Killers\" who lured their victims through the personals." ;
   <https://schema.org/actor> <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000237> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0001467> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0001254> , <http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000161> ;
