   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Cat and mouse. Jonathan McQuarry is an auditor in Manhattan, moving from office to office checking their books. While working late, a smooth and well-dressed man named Wyatt Bose chats Jonathan up, offers him a joint, and soon they're pals. When their cell phones are accidentally swapped, Jonathan answers Wyatt's phone to a series of women asking if he's free tonight. Jonathan discovers it's a sex club: busy powerful people meet each other anonymously in hotels. Jonathan falls for one of the club members, whom he knows only as \"S,\" whom he's also seen on a subway. When she goes missing, patterns emerge and Jonathan faces demands involving violence and lots of money." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" .
