   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:rating> "5.9"^^xsd:float ;
   <urn:stardog:demos:movies:storyline> "Georgia is an American academic who's lost her teaching job in Athens. She's taken a job as a tour guide, but she hates it and it shows: the tourists, mostly American, are bored with history and facts; they want to shop. Every group has a goofy couple, a frat boy, a sullen teen, a feuding couple, divorcées looking for a mate, and a funny guy. This group is no exception, plus there's no air conditioning and a bearded silent driver. Thanks to an unlikely friendship, plus daisies, an ice-cream cone, the history of syrup, and the Oracle at Delphi, Georgia may have a shot at finding her kefi during this four-day tour." ;
   <https://schema.org/inLanguage> "English" , "Greek" .
<http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0866437> a <https://schema.org/Movie> ;
   rdfs:label "The Jane Austen Book Club" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "Six Californians start a club to discuss the works of Jane Austen, only to find their relationships -- both old and new -- begin to resemble 21st century versions of her novels." ;
