   rdfs:label "Beasts of the Southern Wild" ;
   <https://schema.org/description> "Faced with both her hot-tempered father's fading health and melting ice-caps that flood her ramshackle bayou community and unleash ancient aurochs, six-year-old Hushpuppy must learn the ways of courage and love." ;
